{
  "id": "galar-collection",
  "name": "Galar Collection",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Three boxes released on 15 November 2019 with the Pokémon Sword and Shield games, the first products of the Sword & Shield TCG Series. Each featured one Galar first partner and held line holofoil copies of all three, Grookey, Scorbunny and Sobble: the featured one as a promo (SWSH001 to SWSH003), the other two as cards from the coming Sword & Shield set, found in no booster pack. Each also held an oversize Zacian V or Zamazenta V shown before the set came out, without the Pokémon's type, Weakness, Resistance, Retreat Cost, Ability, Energy costs or Evolution Stage, a pin and four booster packs.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon: Galar Collection",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-tcg/product-gallery/galar-collection"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Sword & Shield TCG Series merchandise, Galar Collection",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sword_%26_Shield_TCG_Series_merchandise#Galar_Collection"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Jumbo cards (TCG)",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Jumbo_cards_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
